{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trenchmen is a stylized World War I strategy game about the brutal dance of offense and defense across the front line. In this game, you build up a strong defensive line in your trenches and organize attacks to capture the enemy\u2019s trenches by recruiting soldiers, fortifying your defenses, and calling in artillery barrages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several types of soldiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your squads, train your troops, and lead them into intense battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in powerful artillery strikes that can turn the tide of battle in an instant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your trenches with multiple upgrades to increase your soldiers\u2019 chances of survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094020?t=1761832192","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094020?t=1761832192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094020/c60f74f9d74057b736cd7b8e0ce4711eab40b093/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761832192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094020/c60f74f9d74057b736cd7b8e0ce4711eab40b093/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761832192","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game depicts scenes of battlefield violence in a stylized pixel art form. Players will encounter blood effects, dead soldiers, and dismembered body parts during gameplay. While the visual style is pixelated and not realistic, the themes of war, death, and violence are present throughout the experience. The game does not include sexual content, drug or alcohol use, or references to self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trenchmen is a stylized World War I strategy game about the brutal dance of offense and defense across the front line. In this game, you build up a strong defensive line in your trenches and organize attacks to capture the enemy\u2019s trenches by recruiting soldiers, fortifying your defenses, and calling in artillery barrages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several types of soldiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your squads, train your troops, and lead them into intense battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in powerful artillery strikes that can turn the tide of battle in an instant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your trenches with multiple upgrades to increase your soldiers\u2019 chances of survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Cognivore Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094020/391dbef8b4471c67cac49502b5350a53c8471628/header.jpg?t=1761832192","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1, M2, M3, M4<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4094020/420881463/fae55595cd809be81f1add9524b3e5f5f052e64a/1761299668/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761832190","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.